```

### 3.3 Retrieve All Buses

| Attribute | Details |
|---|---|
| Endpoint | `/api/buses/` |
| HTTP Method | GET |
| Purpose | Retrieve information about all registered buses |
| Access | Frontend |

**Example Response:**

```json
[
  {
    "bus_id": "DKIT_BUS_01",
    "capacity": 25,
    "current_passengers": 12,
    "crowd_status": "Normal",
    "active": true
